<title>SPAIN: Spain Q1 unemployment declines to 21.49 percent.</title>
<headline>Spain Q1 unemployment declines to 21.49 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish unemployment from January to March 1997 fell to 21.49 percent, the National Statistics Institute INE said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the last quarter of 1996 it stood at 21.78 percent.</p>
<p>The data is based on a survey by INE, completed on a quarterly rolling basis. In the period from December 1996 to February 1997 the jobless rate was at 21.66 percent.</p>
</text>
